{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "amara.power",
  "kind": "character",
  "title": "星の法廷へようこそ",
  "summary": "夜の展望デッキから、アマラの本当の法廷——星の海へ",
  "ownership": {
    "arcId": "character.amara",
    "characterId": "amara",
    "stage": "power"
  },
  "trigger": {
    "actions": [
      "work",
      "rest"
    ],
    "when": {
      "all": [],
      "any": [],
      "none": []
    },
    "repeat": {
      "mode": "once-per-run"
    },
    "priority": 400,
    "weight": 1
  },
  "presentation": {
    "location": "夜の展望デッキ",
    "assets": [
      {
        "id": "amara.power.asset.background.001",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-observation-deck-night.png",
        "alt": "夜の展望デッキの背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "amara.power.asset.sprite.character",
        "kind": "sprite",
        "path": "/assets/battle/fighters/amara-v1.png",
        "alt": "天秤の裁定者アマラ"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「見せたいものがあります」アマラさんに呼ばれたのは、夜の展望デッキ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜景の見える場所に、二人。これは、あれだろうか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "世間で言う、その。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "力量測定です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ですよね。浮かれた三秒を、返してほしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "隣で、新人くんが私の袖をつかんで震えてる。分かる。この空気は、何かが起きる空気。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.power.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "amara.power.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.power.node.direction.character.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "amara.power.asset.sprite.character",
        "actorId": "amara",
        "slot": "right",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ここからは、私の法廷で行います。——開廷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "amara.power.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "flash"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜景が、めくれた。手すりの向こうが星の海に変わる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "星でできた傍聴席、光の天秤。足元は、宇宙に引かれた白い一本線だけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——ここが、この人の本当の法廷。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "お、落ちる落ちる落ちます——!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "落ちません。法廷内では、私から離れないでください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "白い手袋が、私の手を取った。隣へ引き寄せられて、手をつないだまま宇宙に立ってる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "心臓の音が、傍聴席まで聞こえそう。耳まで熱くて、そっちも心配。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "新人くんが震えながら計測器を向けると、三秒で「規格外」、五秒で煙を吹いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "新人くんは計測を諦め、記録板に「でかい」とだけ書いた。私も見た。でかかった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "神罰は、規則違反へ下すものではない。規則が人を害した時に、規則へ下すものです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "それ、会社に聞かれたら困るやつです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "記録してください。聞かせるために言いました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "光の天秤に、星が一つずつ降りてくる。全部、彼女が一人で下した判決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.013b",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.013b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この星空の数だけ、ずっと一人だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……この景色、今まで誰に見せてたんですか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "誰にも。最後まで見届ける者がいない場所で、本気を出すべきではないので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "つないだ手に、少しだけ力がこもった。世界を裁ける人を、見ている人が今までいなかった。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.017a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.017a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "安心してください。傍聴席は、残します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.017b",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.017b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あなたには、最後まで見届けてもらう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.018a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.018a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "はい。ただし、条件つきです。次に本気を出すかは、一人で決めないでください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.019a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.019a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.14shtqw",
      "speakerName": "アマラ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……記録に残します。「本法廷に、合議制が導入された」と。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.020a",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.020a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "気づけば、展望デッキはいつもの夜景に戻ってた。手は、三十秒くらいつながれたままだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.020b",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.020b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "どちらも、指摘しなかった。箸袋の第四号が、ポケットに増えてた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "amara.power.node.line.020c",
      "lineId": "amara.power.line.020c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「本日の傍聴人は、被告に条件を付けた。前例のない越権。受理する」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "amara.power.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "amara.power.choice.001",
          "label": "星の法廷の天秤へ、アルデバラン社の契約原本を載せる",
          "result": "天秤は会社側へ大きく傾き、星の傍聴席がざわめいた。重いのは紙じゃなく、従わせてきた年月。アマラさんは天秤を見つめ「判決は、まだ出しません」傍聴席に私がいる間は、急がないみたい",
          "intent": "本来の力を一気に取り戻す",
          "promise": "失敗時の危険を引き受け、この人専用の成長を最大まで進める。",
          "memory": "星の法廷で怖いまま隣に立ったことを、アマラは危機の場面で思い出す。",
          "tone": "heroic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "amara"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 10,
              "ownership": -4
            },
            {
              "type": "fighterPoints",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "amara"
              },
              "amount": 5
            }
          ],
          "goto": "amara.power.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "amara.power.choice.002",
          "label": "今夜は大会規則だけを量り、違反技を封じる",
          "result": "星の海は全部使わず、相手が隠してた一手だけ止めた。小さな判決ほど、チームには扱いやすい。新人くんの報告書は「制御良好、たぶん世界一やさしい規格外」上長に三回突き返された",
          "intent": "安全な段階解除で確実に進む",
          "promise": "本来の力は一部に留め、チーム全体の成長へ成果を持ち帰る。",
          "memory": "全員で帰ると決めた手順が、危機で使える安全策として残る。",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "amara"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 0,
              "ownership": 9
            },
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 5
            }
          ],
          "goto": "amara.power.node.effect.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "amara.power.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "setStoryStage",
          "fighterId": "amara",
          "stage": 4
        }
      ]
    },
